                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1e3b4e4-2841-495f-b514-01400a34c2d4",
                                                "sense_id": "75734a5e-6a78-3406-b9b3-ceba88339083",
                                                "text": "Deep clerks she dumbs; and with her needle composes\nNature's own shape, of bud, bird, branch, or berry,\nThat even her art sisters the natural roses;\nHer inkle, silk, twin with the rubied cherry"
